From eae879fd74739ac32d77ab85991bfef9627c9cc6 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Rasheed <arasheedu@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 29 Oct 2026 14:53:48 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 02/10] llm: emit decode trace events from the llama-server
 stream

When a request carries a tracer, ask llama-server for top-10 probabilities
and per-token timings, tokenize the exact prompt with /tokenize
with_pieces (via /apply-template on the native chat path), synthesize one
prefill batch from prompt_n/prompt_ms and emit decode.step.start,
decode.logits and decode.sample for every streamed chunk. Probabilities
requested only for tracing never reach the client.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>
